{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつきっ(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼本日の写メぃ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/16/1474374/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも凄い久しぶりにタピオカを買いにいけて、テンションがあがったせいで、新しい味に挑戦したらなんとも不思議な味で私には合わずに泣きそうになりました若月です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、ちょっと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最悪最低なことが起きてしまったので今日はブログこの辺ですみません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一応言います。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月、電車反対方向に乗って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終点につきました。知らない土地に着きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこから戻ろうと思って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車に乗ったら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また別の電車に乗り換えてしまったらしく、人の誰１人いない土地に着きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれ。私はどこに向かっているの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月全力で泣きました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここは誰。私はどこ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日朝早いの・゜・(つД｀)・゜・"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私を家に帰して・゜・(つД｀)・゜・"}],"source":"archive"}